{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269AvFknh2qs1793284094.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>蒙彼利埃乒乓冠軍賽，張本智和於男單首圈止步。</p><p></p><p>左方的張本智和面對東道主球手哥斯，首局領先10-8被逼到「刁時」，輸13-15。</p><p></p><p>這位世界第三的日本球手，日前在亞錦賽成功衛冕，第二局領先5-4時，他連失5分，輸7-11，世界第三對排名30，過去五次交手全勝，第三局他全程落後，輸多局6-11，直落三局輸球，哥斯16強對梁靖崑。</p><p></p><p>排名39、深色衫的梁靖崑，淘汰排名14的國家隊友溫瑞博。連贏13-11、11-8及11-4，兩次對賽都勝出，用25分鐘打入16強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.738145+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:18:08.394819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.248984+00:00","content_hash":"caeb2232711cc4bd492e5636af4458ba3c18b8ad391f8ec458860b67c23b5efb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.738145+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}